<%# Test for text escaping helper %>
<% special_chars = "#$*_[]\\<>{}@" %>
<% price = "$100" %>
<% hashtag = "#important" %>

= Text Escaping Test

== Special Characters
Raw special characters: <%= escape_typst(special_chars) %>

== Price Example
The price is <%= escape_typst(price) %>

== Hashtag Example
This is <%= escape_typst(hashtag) %> information

== Multiple Escapes in One Line
Code <%= escape_typst("#define") %> and math <%= escape_typst("$x^2$") %>

== Empty and Nil Handling
Empty: <%= escape_typst("") %>
Normal text: <%= escape_typst("Hello World") %>

This document tests that all Typst special characters are properly escaped
and don't interfere with document compilation.
